text = "Left-drag the ground: move the city    Left-drag a person, taxi or tree: pick up (wiggle to uproot), flick to throw
Click: tap / knock on a wall    Double-click: fly there    Middle-drag: orbit    Wheel: zoom    Keys: WASD, Q/E, R/F    B: belief (debug)
Hold LEFT still on the ground: miracle wheel (pick one, then click to cast it)    On a building: decrees and signs    Right-drag a circle: water
The hand can lift anything. Only miracles change what people believe."

